# Web-Based Academic Progress Tracking System (WAPTS)

## Project Goal

Build a web-based academic progress tracking system that enables higher institutions to manage academic records while providing students with intelligent tools to monitor and improve their academic performance.

Unlike a traditional result management system, this application must actively analyze academic data to provide performance trends, risk detection, progress tracking, and personalized insights.

---

# Core Objectives

The system shall:

* Manage departments, academic sessions, semesters, courses, and users.
* Record attendance, continuous assessment (CA), and examination scores.
* Automatically compute final course scores.
* Automatically compute GPA and CGPA.
* Track academic progress across semesters.
* Detect declining academic performance.
* Notify students of important academic events.
* Provide dashboards and analytics for students, lecturers, HODs, and administrators.
* Generate transcripts.

