# User Roles

## 1. Admin

### Authentication

* Username
* Password

Admin accounts are created manually by the developer.

### Permissions

* Create departments
* Create academic sessions
* Create semesters
* Create HOD accounts
* Manage system configuration
* Monitor system usage
* View audit logs (optional)

Admin cannot upload academic records.

---

## 2. Head of Department (HOD)

### Authentication

* Institutional email
* Password

### Permissions

* Approve lecturer registration requests
* Create department courses
* Manage curriculum
* Assign lecturers to courses
* Manage course offerings per semester
* View departmental analytics
* Monitor student performance
* Monitor lecturer performance

Cannot modify student grades.

---

## 3. Lecturer

### Authentication

* Institutional email
* Password (generated during onboarding, change required on first login)

### Permissions

View assigned courses only.

For each assigned course:

* Record attendance
* Upload Continuous Assessment scores
* Upload Examination scores
* Submit final grades
* Edit grades before final submission
* View course statistics
* View pass/fail distribution

Cannot access courses not assigned.

---

## 4. Student

### Authentication

* Registration Number
* Password

### Permissions

View only personal academic information.

Features:

* Dashboard
* Semester GPA
* Overall CGPA
* Attendance
* Academic progress
* Performance analytics
* Credit summary
* Goal tracking
* Transcript
* Notifications

Cannot edit academic records.

