# Academic Risk Detection

Automatically detect students who may require intervention.

Possible rules

Low GPA

```text
GPA < Configured Threshold
```

Low attendance

```text
Attendance < Configured Threshold
```

Multiple failed courses

```text
Failed Courses >= Configured Threshold
```

Generate academic warnings visible to:

* Student
* HOD (optional)
* Academic Advisor (future)

