# Key Business Rules

* Only Admin can create HOD accounts.
* Only HOD can approve lecturer registrations.
* Lecturers can only manage courses assigned to them.
* Students can only access their own records.
* GPA and CGPA are computed automatically.
* Results become visible only after final submission/approval (if an approval workflow is implemented).
* Attendance percentages update automatically whenever attendance records change.
* All analytics update whenever academic records are modified.
* Role-based authorization is enforced across the system.

